WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:07.000
Start with your wedding: couple, events, dates and venues.

00:07.000 --> 00:14.000
Read the guest's script and record your own voice or video.

00:14.000 --> 00:21.000
Preview the invitation and download the generated video.

00:21.000 --> 00:28.000
Both families share a workspace. Track individual guest RSVPs.

00:28.000 --> 00:35.000
Plan separate travel groups and see arrival and pickup details.

00:35.000 --> 00:42.000
Planners coordinate vehicles, pickups, hotels and rooms.
